Well I've been sitting here looking at all the ideas people are
introducing and I've noticed that nobody (as far as I know) has 
suggested any new rings.  So I came up with a couple.

1. Gravity Ring  Cursed - Increase pack load to point where character
                          collapses under his load. To move the player
                          would have to drop everything .     
         
               Uncursed - Randomly increase/decrease a players load each
                          time that it was put on. 

                Blessed - Would act the same as a bag of holding, except
                          no bag would be required.  Advantages include
                          including the gold you have in with the holding
                          spell on a bag of holding.

2. Ring of Insubstaniality

   Grants player the same abilities as an Earth Elemental with the added
bonus of being able to go down wherever he/she might be without digging
a hole or using a stairwell/trapdoor.  Would not allow player to use
any tools, weapons, food while wearing it.  Player would also not be able
to pick things up BUT WOULD be vulnerable to attack by other monsters.

Cursed - can't remove. That's bad enough.

Uncursed - Can remove. 

BLessed - Would protect the wearer by adding -1 to the players AC while
          wearing.

3. Ring of Surprise

   Same as a wand of anything. Would randomly imitate any other ring.  A
different ring everytime it was put on.  Standard Cursed/Blessed/Uncursed
states.


